member.remarks:
note: calling
img.Save(stream, ImageFormat.Jpeg);
is much faster, but doesn't work with some images. it seems the .NET jpg filter can read some images that Adobe cannot.

member.example:
Use line break for new paragraph into Word/RTF document:

RtfSection section = new RtfSection();
section.Add(new RtfLineBreak());
